{%- comment -%}
  Inline icon set for the Gift Guide sections.

  Inlined rather than sprited so an icon costs no request and inherits
  currentColor.

  Usage:
    {% render 'gg-icon', name: 'arrow' %}
    {% render 'gg-icon', name: 'arrow', class: 'gg-btn__arrow' %}

  Params:
    name  - arrow | plus | close | chevron
    class - optional extra class
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign icon_class = class | default: ''
-%}

{%- case name -%}
  {%- when 'arrow' -%}
    <svg class="gg-icon {{ icon_class }}" viewBox="0 0 24 12" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M0 6h21M16 1l5 5-5 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'plus' -%}
    <svg class="gg-icon {{ icon_class }}" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'close' -%}
    <svg class="gg-icon {{ icon_class }}" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M5 5l10 10M15 5L5 15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'chevron' -%}
    <svg class="gg-icon {{ icon_class }}" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M5 8l5 5 5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%}
    Hamburger trigger. Figma's two states — 18x10 three-bar hamburger, and a
    12.7279x12.9994 X — are one Smart Animate interaction, not two separate
    icons: 18 * cos(45deg) = 12.7279, so the X is the same top/bottom bars
    rotated 45deg to meet in the centre while the middle bar fades. This is
    the classic hamburger-to-X morph, driven by CSS transform/opacity on
    aria-expanded — see .gg-banner__menu in assets/gg-banner.css.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'hamburger' -%}
    <svg class="gg-icon {{ icon_class }}" viewBox="0 0 18 10" width="18" height="10" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path class="gg-icon__bar gg-icon__bar--1" d="M0 1H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path class="gg-icon__bar gg-icon__bar--2" d="M0 5H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path class="gg-icon__bar gg-icon__bar--3" d="M0 9H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>
{%- endcase -%}
